/**
 * Lark Bot — Knowledge Context Builder
 *
 * Two layers of knowledge:
 * 1. STATIC: Comprehensive project knowledge (architecture, patterns, conventions)
 *    — Auto-generated by CI via `scripts/generate-knowledge.ts`
 *    — Stored in `KNOWLEDGE.md` at project root
 * 2. DYNAMIC: GitHub Code Search at query time
 *    — Searches relevant code snippets when user asks specific questions
 *    — Injected into AI context for accurate answers
 */
